Subject: [PWG-Announce] PWG November 2020 Face-to-Face Meeting - Summary
To: PWG Announcements Reflector <pwg-announce@pwg.org>


Greetings,

The PWG held its November 2020 Virtual Face-to-Face Meeting on November
3-5, 2020 via Zoom teleconferences. Representatives from Canon, High North,
HP Inc., Konica Minolta, Kyocera, Lakeside Robotics, Lexmark, Qualcomm,
Ricoh, TIC, TCS and Xerox attended the meetings, among others. Attendees
reviewed work in progress, including drafts of a number of in-progress
specifications, and discussed liaisons with partner groups. Click here for
a summary of the proceedings:

https://www.pwg.org/blog/pwg-november-2020-F2F-summary.html

Thanks to all who attended! Stay healthy!

Smith

/**
    Smith Kennedy
    Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
*/


